    "NAME": "Trustblocks · Street Resurfacing Notice Of Award",
    "DESCRIPTION": "The Notice of Award and Acceptance of Notice -- Exhibit \"I\" of the STR-27",
    "MODEL": "namespace com.trustblocks.municipal.construction.noticeofaward@1.0.0\n\n/**\n * The Notice of Award and Acceptance of Notice -- Exhibit \"I\" of the STR-27\n * bid package: the Town tells the successful bidder the Council accepted its\n * bid, and asks for the executed contract, certifications, W-9, insurance and\n * bonds within the response days. Every blank is a field; sample.json is the\n * form as issued.\n */\n@template\nasset NoticeOfAward identified by noticeId {\n  o String noticeId\n  @description(\"The Contractor, as addressed\")\n  o String addresseeName optional\n  o String addresseeStreet optional\n  o String addresseeCityStateZip optional\n  @description(\"The Town's contract number, e.g. STR-27\")\n  o String contractNumber\n  o DateTime invitationToBidDate optional\n  @description(\"The Town Council meeting that accepted the bid\")\n  o DateTime councilMeetingDate optional\n  @description(\"Days after the Notice within which the contract documents are due\")\n  o Integer responseDays\n  o String responseDaysWritten\n  o DateTime dated optional\n  o String managerName\n  o String managerSignature optional\n  // ---- Acceptance of Notice (the Contractor)\n  o DateTime acceptedDate optional\n  o String acceptorName optional\n  o String acceptorSignature optional\n  o String acceptanceWitnessTitle optional\n}\n",
    "TEMPLATE": "# NOTICE OF AWARD AND ACCEPTANCE OF NOTICE\n\nTO: {{#optional addresseeName}}{{this}}{{else}}\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_{{/optional}}\n\n{{#optional addresseeStreet}}{{this}}{{else}}\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_{{/optional}}\n\n{{#optional addresseeCityStateZip}}{{this}}{{else}}\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_{{/optional}}\n\nFROM: Town of China Grove, 333 North Main Street, China Grove, North Carolina 28023\n\n**PROJECT: Street Resurfacing, Contract No. {{contractNumber}}**\n\nYou are hereby notified that the bid submitted by you for the above-named project, in response to the Town of China Grove's Invitation to Bid dated {{#optional invitationToBidDate}}{{this as \"MMMM D, YYYY\"}}{{else}}\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_{{/optional}}, has been accepted by the China Grove Town Council at its meeting of {{#optional councilMeetingDate}}{{this as \"MMMM D, YYYY\"}}{{else}}\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_{{/optional}}.\n\nYou are hereby requested to execute the formal Standard Form Construction Contract with the Town of China Grove and to furnish your executed Exhibit \"B\" Affidavit and Certifications, IRS Form W-9, Certificate of Insurance, Performance Bond, Payment Bond, any associated Power of Attorney, and any other contract documents pertaining to the work as designated by the Town of China Grove, within {{responseDaysWritten}} ({{responseDays}}) days after the date of this Notice of Award.\n\nDated this the {{#optional dated}}{{this as \"D\"}} day of {{this as \"MMMM, YYYY\"}}{{else}}\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ day of \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, 2026{{/optional}}.\n\nTown of China Grove, North Carolina\n\nBy: {{#optional managerSignature}}{{this}}{{else}}\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_{{/optional}}\n\n{{managerName}}, Town Manager\n\n## ACCEPTANCE OF NOTICE\n\nReceipt of the above NOTICE OF AWARD is hereby acknowledged this the {{#optional acceptedDate}}{{this as \"D\"}} day of {{this as \"MMMM, YYYY\"}}{{else}}\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ day of \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, 2026{{/optional}}.\n\n{{#optional acceptorName}}{{this}}{{else}}\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_{{/optional}}\n\nBy: {{#optional acceptorSignature}}{{this}}{{else}}\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_{{/optional}}\n\nWitness Title: {{#optional acceptanceWitnessTitle}}{{this}}{{else}}\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_{{/optional}}\n",
